---
import Article from "../../layouts/article.astro";
---

<Article
  showLanguageSwitcher={false}
  title="Book a guided tour"
  description="Book a tour in Paris, from tours in Montmartre to personalised tours"
>
  <h1>Book a guided tour with me</h1>
  <p>
    Hi, I'm Abi and I'm a tour guide in Paris. Here you can find the different
    tours that I offer (new tours coming soon!). You can learn more about me <a
      href="/articles/about/">here</a
    >!
  </p>
  <p>
    My tours are always kept small because I want the tours to be personal.
    Every guide has their own style, and for me, that style is not reciting from
    a book, but rather through telling stories, asking and answering questions
    and sharing the Paris experience.
  </p>
  <p>
    My tours are not just about the places we are walking through, they're also
    about giving you the best experience for your trip. I'm happy to answer
    questions about the city and give advice on what other activities you can
    plan.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you would like to book a tour and the time slots don't work with your
    schedule you can get in contact via <a href="mailto:contact@abisummers.com"
      >contact@abisummers.com</a
    >.
  </p>
  <br />

  <noscript>Book a guided tour</noscript>
  <script
    type="text/javascript"
    src="https://bookeo.com/widget.js?a=3252MKCWA4193B1401C92"></script>

  <p>
    If you don't find what you're looking for, don't hesiate to reach out to me
    via <a href="mailto:contact@abisummers.com">contact@abisummers.com</a> with some
    information about what you'd like to see and do. This might to be to explore
    a specific area (eg Le Marais or close to where you're staying), where to get
    the best street food, or how to plan a trip with children.
  </p>.
  <p>
    Paris has so much to offer, and I love getting to show people the version of
    Paris they're wanting to explore.
  </p>
</Article>
